OL,3,GNEWSALibraries opening staff free amid
OL,4,Areview concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Devon can increasingly access
OL,7,Flibraries outside of normal opening
OL,8,Fhours and without any staff on site.
OL,10,FLibraries Unlimited, the charity that
OL,11,Fruns libraries, is rolling out the new
OL,12,FOpen Plus technology that enables
OL,13,Fpeople to use their membership cards to
OL,14,Fget into the library without staff
OL,15,Fbeing there.
OL,17,FIt is also currently carrying out a
OL,18,Fstaff consultation that could see a
OL,19,Freduction in the number of library
OL,20,Fsupervisors - the charity said there
OL,21,Fwas no connection between Open Plus and
OL,22,Fthe consultation.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
