OL,3,GNEWSALibraries opening staff free amid
OL,4,Areview concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after a huge row earlier in 2026
OL,7,Fover the future of libraries some
OL,8,Fcampaigners and councillors have called
OL,9,Ffor Devon County Council to be involved
OL,10,Fin the staff consultation.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
